<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Crown shares top turnover.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Crown shares top turnover.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Melbourne casino operator Crown Ltd topped turnover lists on Friday with 11.5 million shares or about two percent of its capital traded.</p>
<p>Brokers said the bulk of the trade was a number of lines specialled through Prudential-Bache Securities at various prices in the A$2.30 to A$2.40 range.</p>
<p>Crown shares were two cents lower at A$2.40 at 4.10 p.m. (0510 GMT) on Friday.  </p>
<p>A Crown spokesman was unavailable for comment.</p>
<p>Crown shares closed five cents lower at A$2.37 on turnover of 16.27 million shares.</p>
<p>--Walter Watson 61-2 9373 1810</p>
</text>
